Package: mzspeclib
Title: Read and Write HUPO-PSI mzSpecLib Spectral Libraries
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Helge", "Hecht", email = "helge.hecht@recetox.muni.cz",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6744-996X",
        affiliation = "Masaryk University"))
Description:
    Reads and writes spectral libraries in the HUPO-PSI mzSpecLib format
    (version 1.0) in both of its normative serializations, the plain text
    format and the JSON format. The whole data model is represented - library
    attributes, attribute sets with their inheritance rules, spectra,
    analytes, interpretations, interpretation members, clusters and peak
    lists including mzPAF peak annotations - and is returned as plain lists
    and data.frames, so that no class has to be understood to use the data.
    Accessors present the controlled vocabulary parameters either as written
    (long tables, one row per parameter) or flattened into one row per
    entity, which is the form tabular consumers such as
    MsBackendMzSpecLib need. Nothing in the package depends on Spectra, and
    nothing resolves controlled vocabulary terms against an ontology, so
    results never depend on which version of the PSI-MS ontology happens to
    be installed.
